edrock--0-614ec411e8/","observation_id":"obs_614ec411e822a540898f15e570bc65f7c99b1de4d8e763c931bcb2cccaf8f043","published_at":"2026-11-05T21:04:24Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的 Web Answer 现已正式可用。开发者只需调用一次工具，即可获得基于当前网页信息、由模型综合生成并附带来源链接的回答，无需自行搭建搜索、检索、内容清洗和引用提取流程。","title":"Getting started with Web Answer on Amazon Bedrock AgentCore"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_68cee360942b7e8efa12f49664464d286d4222103c8afad6fa67d9b2060e61b1","internal_url":"/posts/20261106-arxiv-swarmevolve-latent-agent-swarms-for-evolutionary-d-0-6f7078b324/","observation_id":"obs_6f7078b324b1954466218c0ab514603989f805fdd1c106f8621d9fda98e8288f","published_at":"2026-11-05T18:59:29Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"SwarmEvolve 是一种利用大规模智能体群体进行进化式搜索的方法，让智能体在隐空间协作、共享 KV 缓存信息，并结合新颖性筛选与隐式交叉来生成和优化程序。实验显示，它在数学发现与科学计算任务上以更短时间取得了较高平均分。","title":"SwarmEvolve: Latent Agent Swarms for Evolutionary Discovery and Optimization"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_88a612f2b9d9e09fe85c32779b74d6a4a0ca737140afc675eb60eac1496e994b","internal_url":"/posts/20261107-arxiv-xstack-a-benchmark-for-ml-repo-migration-0-c506adad28/","observation_id":"obs_c506adad28825d2b4f3de3c5e292070bbd219fb1a6fa5dc04956dc9de5be67a4","published_at":"2026-11-05T18:55:54Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"XStack 是一个用于评估 AI 代理跨框架、跨硬件迁移机器学习代码仓库的基准。代理需要把 PyTorch 仓库迁移为可在 TPU 上运行的 JAX 仓库，并通过基于原仓库结果的校准评分。","title":"XStack: A Benchmark for ML Repo Migration"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_0d40ab33453c1ffd45f8b8479389ebf75d40c8739f45f4bca22caeb204d73530","internal_url":"/posts/20261106-blogs_podcasts-how-amazon-marketplace-evaluates-content-quality-w-1-fad370bb7b/","observation_id":"obs_fad370bb7b6d436415c6f4ddb8a02e1562eca0569d93ed1a33f1eed45345207d","published_at":"2026-11-05T18:06:43Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这篇文章介绍一种面向电商商品详情页的内容质量评估方案：用视觉语言模型理解整页图片、文字与布局的协同效果，再结合 OCR 可读性信号和 CatBoost 分类器，依据专家标注输出质量判断。方案还利用 SHAP 解释评分依据，并在 Amazon SageMaker AI 上覆盖数据接入、模型托管、监控等环节。","title":"How Amazon Marketplace evaluates content quality with Amazon SageMaker AI"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_6946cf536ab340e76842588cd231fa56c3c087cc3499c2db340bd1952f46e8f6","internal_url":"/posts/20261106-arxiv-a-framework-for-context-enrichment-and-selective-r-0-1ba2bc1e63/","observation_id":"obs_1ba2bc1e6399e93d4fd435a7c22726067a41e0e5dc538d05675de7d9f0122609","published_at":"2026-11-04T18:58:23Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"这篇论文研究如何通过有控制地补充提示上下文，减少大语言模型智能体在语义不变改写下行为的波动，同时保持对社会环境变化的合理响应。作者提出“上下文增强”和“选择性稳健性”框架，并在囚徒困境类博弈中进行了验证。","title":"A Framework for Context Enrichment and Selective Robustness in LLM Social Agents"}],"graph_node_id":"tag:大语言模型","id":"tag:大语言模型","related_topics":[{"cooccurrence":5,"graph_node_id":"tag:AI Agent","id":"tag:AI Agent","jaccard":0.625,"topic":"AI Agent"},{"cooccurrence":4,"graph_node_id":"tag:Prompt 工程","id":"tag:Prompt 工程","jaccard":0.5,"topic":"Prompt 工程"},{"cooccurrence":2,"graph_node_id":"tag:Amazon SageMaker AI","id":"tag:Amazon SageMaker AI","jaccard":0.25,"topic":"Amazon SageMaker AI"},{"cooccurrence":2,"graph_node_id":"tag:机器学习","id":"tag:机器学习","jaccard":0.25,"topic":"机器学习"},{"cooccurrence":2,"graph_node_id":"tag:生成式 AI","id":"tag:生成式 AI","jaccard":0.25,"topic":"生成式 AI"}],"scenarios":[],"schema_version":"stack_trends_topic_v2","sources":[{"count":3,"name":"arxiv"},{"count":3,"name":"blogs_podcasts"},{"count":2,"name":"hacker_news"}],"topic":"大语言模型","windows":{"24h":{"confidence":"medium","counts":{"current":4,"pre_previous":1,"previous":3},"observations":4,"redundant_observations":0,"score":53.75,"source_diversity":2,"sparkline":[2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,2,0],"state":"rising","unique_events":4,"unique_sources":2},"30d":{"confidence":"high","counts":{"current":8,"pre_previous":127,"previous":150},"observations":8,"redundant_obser